          "caption": "Defendants at the Munich High Treason Trial (February–April 1924), including General Erich Ludendorff (centre) and Adolf Hitler (fourth from right): Sympathetic judges let Hitler turn the dock into a national propaganda stage before handing down the minimum five-year sentence."
