            "text": "On the basis of Article 48 of the Reich Constitution, the following is decreed for the protection of the economic and financial life of the nation:\nArticle 1: All statutory civil service salaries, retirement pensions, and war disability allowances are hereby reduced by a further nine percent across all Reich, state, and municipal administrations.\nArticle 2: Standard weekly unemployment insurance payments and crisis relief allowances shall be reduced by twelve percent. The eligibility criteria for receiving benefits are restricted with immediate effect to individuals who can prove complete personal indigence.\nArticle 3: In order to balance the national budget and protect the gold reserves of the Reichsbank against capital flight, official price controls shall be established to enforce a reduction in consumer prices, freight rates, and contractual house rents.",
