                "text": "<p>Interpretation 2 says Hitler became Chancellor because of secret plotting by von Papen and Hindenburg when the Nazis were losing votes and money. On the other hand, Interpretation 1 says it was inevitable because the Depression broke the Reichstag and Hitler had the biggest party.</p>",
