            "primer": "Direct students to paragraphs [3.1]–[3.2]. Explain how judges were forced to join the National Socialist League of Jurists, sworn to rule in accordance with the \"healthy instinct of the people,\" while Roland Freisler led show trials with no juries or appeals.",
            "question": "How did the creation of the People’s Court undermine traditional standards of justice and the rule of law?"
