          "caption": "State-Subsidised Radio Indoctrination (1938 Catalogue): Official Reich radio trade spread promoting hire-purchase monthly instalments for the 35-mark Deutscher Kleinempfänger and Volksempfänger VE 301—pushing German household radio ownership past 70% by 1939 while blocking distant foreign stations."
