          "caption": "Albert Speer’s \"Cathedral of Light\" (Nuremberg, September 1937): Surrounding Zeppelin Field with 152 anti-aircraft searchlights aimed straight into the night sky, chief architect Albert Speer staged awe-inspiring nocturnal rallies magnifying the cult of the Führer.",
