          "caption": "The Cross of Honour of the German Mother (Ehrenkreuz der Deutschen Mutter, instituted December 1938): Awarded annually on 12 August (Hitler’s mother’s birthday), the state medal gave Bronze for 4–5 children, Silver for 6–7, and Gold (shown with its presentation case) for 8 or more 'hereditarily healthy' Aryan children."
